      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Coaching plans",
          "heading": "Jake White will move to live in Fiji in early 2027",
          "body": "Fiji coach Jake White, who led South Africa to 2007 World Cup glory, told The42 before Saturday's Dublin test that he will spend blocks of each year touring the islands. The Fiji U18 and U20 squads will start touring South Africa every year, and White plans to coach in schools and clubs, seeing a need to supplement Fiji's traditional culture of flair. \"No one mauls in Fiji,\" he says, and nobody coaches it."
        },
