          "kicker": "Try-scoring haul",
          "heading": "Will Joseph scored five tries as England beat Japan 78-15",
          "body": "Twickenham on Saturday produced 13 England tries, five of them from Will Joseph, who was rated 10/10 in one outlet's player ratings. England head coach Steve Borthwick told ITV afterwards he would \"praise the bench\" and that \"they were great\", after a match in which viewers' complaints centred on ITV's in-game adverts rather than the rugby itself, which drew no complaints."
        },
