          "body": "Japan coach Eddie Jones had vowed his side would 'play the house down' at Twickenham, but Japan were beaten 78-15 by England on Saturday. The Brave Blossoms had a player sent off before touching the ball, according to The Guardian, and England ran in 13 tries. The defeat leaves Japan with one win from five matches in the log, with Scotland next."
